              "texto": "Farther away: [[6062|aquel, aquella]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "eso, ese (alone)",
              "texto": "Without a noun: [[6060|ese, esa, eso as pronouns]]."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kwiz",
      "titulo": "Check yourself",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Say it out loud, then open the answer."
